          ],
          "level": 1,
          "content": "Chapter – 1 Large Numbers Around Us"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.177,
            0.229,
            0.195
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Page No. 3"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.207,
            0.288,
            0.225
          ],
          "content": "**Figure it out**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.228,
            0.883,
            0.287
          ],
          "content": "**1. According to the 2011 Census, the population of the town of Chintamani was about 75,000. How much less than one lakh is 75,000?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.291,
            0.541,
            0.31
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 75,000 is 25,000 less than 1 lakh."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.32,
            0.881,
            0.381
          ],
          "content": "**2. The estimated population of Chintamani in the year 2024 is 1,06,000. How much more than one lakh is 1,06,000?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.384,
            0.562,
            0.403
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 1,06,000 is 6,000 more than 1 lakh."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.414,
            0.881,
            0.453
          ],
          "content": "**3. By how much did the population of Chintamani increase from 2011 to 2024?**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.457,
            0.719,
            0.476
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** Increase in population from 2011 to 2024 is 31,000."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.209,
            0.486,
            0.883,
            0.549
          ],
          "content": "**Look at the picture on the right. Somu is 1 metre tall. If each floor is about four times his height, what is the approximate height of the building? (Refer textbook for the picture)**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.176,
            0.56,
            0.282,
            0.578
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** 40 m"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.589,
            0.881,
            0.63
          ],
          "content": "？ **Which is taller — The Statue of Unity or this building? How much** taller? m."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.175,
            0.631,
            0.733,
            0.651
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** The Statue of Unity is 140 m taller than the building."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.145,
            0.666,
            0.881,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": "？ **How tall is the Kunchikal waterfall compared to the building?** 410 m."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.146,
            0.687,
            0.881,
            0.728
          ],
          "content": "？ **How many floors should Somu’s building have to be as high as the waterfall?** <u>approx 113 floors</u> ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.117,
            0.744,
            0.229,
            0.763
          ],
          "content": "**Page No. 4**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.774,
            0.632,
            0.793
          ],
          "content": "**Write each of the numbers given below in words:**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.147,
            0.803,
            0.291,
            0.821
          ],
          "content": "**(a) 3,00,600**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.199,
            0.832,
            0.487,
            0.85
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** Three lakh six hundred"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.148,
            0.86,
            0.29,
            0.879
          ],
          "content": "**(b) 5,04,085**"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.2,
            0.888,
            0.6,
            0.908
          ],
          "content": "**Ans:** Five lakh four thousand eighty five"
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.493,
